splits:
  - split_details: >-
      Recommended training/validation/testing splits in 70/15/15 proportions are provided in the
      participants.tsv file included with the dataset: 1,576 training, 352 validation and 352 test
      participants. Because sex, race and ethnicity are not released with the public dataset, the
      project team prepared the splits so that the validation and test sets are balanced as far as
      possible for sex, race/ethnicity and diabetes status (no diabetes, pre-diabetes or lifestyle
      controlled, oral medication controlled, insulin controlled). The splits are intended to reduce
      disparities in models developed using this dataset.

